ssets/img/photos/north-shore-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/north-shore.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Oahu · City and County of Honolulu</small><b>Mililani &amp; Wahiawa</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/hilo-big-island/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hilo-bay.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hilo-bay-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hilo-bay.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Hawaii Island · Hawaii County</small><b>Hilo</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/kailua-kona-big-island/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kona-coast.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kona-coast-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kona-coast.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Hawaii Island · Hawaii County</small><b>Kailua-Kona</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/puna-pahoa-big-island/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lava-zone-homes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lava-zone-homes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lava-zone-homes.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Hawaii Island · Hawaii County</small><b>Puna &amp; Pahoa</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/kahului-wailuku-maui/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/maui-valley.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/maui-valley-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/maui-valley.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="726" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Maui · Maui County</small><b>Kahului &amp; Wailuku</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/kihei-wailea-maui/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kihei-coast.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kihei-coast-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kihei-coast.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="837" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Maui · Maui County</small><b>Kihei &amp; Wailea</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/lahaina-west-maui/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lahaina-harbor.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lahaina-harbor-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lahaina-harbor.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Maui · Maui County</small><b>Lahaina &amp; West Maui</b></span></a><a class="ccard rv" href="/island-communities/lihue-kauai/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kauai-coast.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kauai-coast-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kauai-coast.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cc-b"><small>Kauai · Kauai County</small><b>Lihue &amp; Kapaa</b></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker">By island</p><h2>How claims differ from island to island</h2><p>The same policy language plays out differently in a Waikiki tower, a Puna catchment home and a Kula ranch house.</p></div><div class="ilist" data-stagger><div class="icard rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/honolulu-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/honolulu-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/honolulu-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Honolulu County</small><h2>Oahu</h2><p>Most of the state’s people — and most of its high-rise condos — live on Oahu. Water losses that travel between units, roof damage from Kona-storm winds and flash flooding on the windward side make up a large share of disputed files, alongside leeward brush fires near Waianae and Makakilo.</p><p class="muted">Honolulu, Kailua, Kaneohe, Pearl City, Aiea, Kapolei, Ewa Beach, Mililani, Wahiawa</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hilo-bay.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hilo-bay-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hilo-bay.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Hawaii County</small><h2>Hawaii Island</h2><p>The Big Island packs rain forest, ranchland and active volcanoes into one county. Hurricane Lane’s rainfall in 2018 hit the Hilo side hard the same year Kilauea’s eruption took homes in lower Puna, and vog keeps metal roofs and fixtures on the Kona side under constant attack.</p><p class="muted">Hilo, Kailua-Kona, Pahoa, Waimea, Volcano, Honokaa, Kau</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/maui-valley.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/maui-valley-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/maui-valley.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="726" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Maui County</small><h2>Maui</h2><p>Since August 2023, wildfire has defined Maui claims: total losses in Lahaina, partial losses and smoke in Upcountry, and long arguments about rebuilding costs as labor and materials stretch thin. Kona storms and trade-wind gusts add roof and water claims across Central and South Maui.</p><p class="muted">Kahului, Wailuku, Kihei, Wailea, Lahaina, Napili, Kula, Pukalani, Makawao</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kauai-coast.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kauai-coast-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kauai-coast.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Kauai County</small><h2>Kauai</h2><p>Kauai carries the memory of Iwa in 1982 and Iniki in 1992, and the 2018 north shore floods showed how fast rainfall can overwhelm roads and homes. Hurricane deductibles, wind-driven rain and the cost of shipping materials to the Garden Isle shape many disputes.</p><p class="muted">Lihue, Kapaa, Wailua, Koloa, Poipu, Princeville, Hanalei, Waimea</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-surf-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-surf.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><small>Maui County · Kalawao</small><h2>Molokai &amp; Lanai</h2><p>Small communities mean few local contractors and long lead times. Estimates for Molokai and Lanai need realistic freight, barge schedules and travel for crews — items carrier estimates sometimes price as if the home were in town on Oahu.</p><p class="muted">Kaunakakai, Maunaloa, Kalaupapa, Lanai City</p></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your community?</h2><p>We cover every island and all five counties. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
